# Morph (docs/43): a flat shape melting into another, point by point, like
# Manim's Transform. The square becomes a circle, then a star, then a
# triangle; the circle turns into a hexagon.

scene "morph"
title "Morph"

shape = square teal filled big important create 0s-1s becomes circle at 2s-3s becomes star at 4s-5s becomes triangle at 6s-7s
other = circle yellow right_of shape becomes hexagon at 2s-4s
